Infrastructure Design: 0-Simple Web Stack
1. Components:

Server: A single machine hosting the stack.

Domain Name: foobar.com (maps to IP 8.8.8.8).

DNS Record: www is a CNAME or A record pointing to the server.

Web Server (Nginx): Handles HTTP requests.

App Server: Executes the application code.

Database (MySQL): Stores website data.

2. Issues:

SPOF: One server means if it fails, everything fails.

Downtime: Deploying code causes downtime.

Scalability: Cannot scale horizontally as traffic increases.
